        "original_id": "bf172b78-e45a-5b8c-8dc9-69d1ba25fbe9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Kiss Kiss (Bang Bang), Iron Man, Iron Man 2, The Avengers, Iron Man 3\n- People: Paul Bettany, Stellan Skarsgård, Chris Penn\n- Characters: J.A.R.V.I.S., Vision\n- Franchises: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n\nFacts:\n- The film \"Kiss Kiss (Bang Bang)\" features Stellan Skarsgård, Chris Penn, and Paul Bettany.\n- Paul Bettany is known for voicing J.A.R.V.I.S. and portraying Vision in the Marvel Cinematic Universe.\n- Paul Bettany voiced J.A.R.V.I.S. in \"Iron Man\" (2008).\n- Paul Bettany voiced J.A.R.V.I.S. in \"Iron Man 2\" (2010).\n- Paul Bettany voiced J.A.R.V.I.S. in \"The Avengers\" (2012).\n- Paul Bettany voiced J.A.R.V.I.S. in \"Iron Man 3\" (2013).\n- Paul Bettany received praise for his Marvel Cinematic Universe roles as J.A.R.V.I.S. and Vision.",
